{"parse": {"title": "LEE-02", "pageid": 88298, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/LEE-01\" title=\"LEE-01\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">LEE-02</span><a href=\"/wiki/LEE-03\" title=\"LEE-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">LEE</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">02</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E2.80.9C.E8.87.AA.E7.94.B1.E6.B5.B7.E9.A3.8E.E2.80.9D\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"“自由海风”\">“自由海风”</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> “自由海风”</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">\"Free Breeze\"</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>啊<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>海<span class=\"color-value\"></span>风<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span>啊<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>自<span class=\"color-value\"></span>由<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span>啊<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>最<span class=\"color-value\"></span>后<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>日<span class=\"color-value\"></span>假<span class=\"color-value\"></span>期<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 2410102</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_4_bg_jiedao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_4_bg_jiedao\"><img alt=\"2_4_bg_jiedao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/Cg-2_4_bg_jiedao.png/600px-Cg-2_4_bg_jiedao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/Cg-2_4_bg_jiedao.png/900px-Cg-2_4_bg_jiedao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/Cg-2_4_bg_jiedao.png/1200px-Cg-2_4_bg_jiedao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>星锑船长，我们似乎偏离了去往拉普拉斯的航向。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\"></div><div>前往科算中心的路途总是遍布坎坷。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>伟大的海盗依靠的从来都不是罗盘，而是一颗勇往直前的心！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>原来如此，我还以为你借机支开维尔汀小姐，只是为了行使度过最后一天假期的权利。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>咳咳。这当然也很重要！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>如同特洛伊战争后凯旋的奥德修斯，船长身手矫健地闯入眼前的一个个漩涡。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_4_bg_jiedao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_4_bg_jiedao\"><img alt=\"2_4_bg_jiedao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/Cg-2_4_bg_jiedao.png/600px-Cg-2_4_bg_jiedao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/Cg-2_4_bg_jiedao.png/900px-Cg-2_4_bg_jiedao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/Cg-2_4_bg_jiedao.png/1200px-Cg-2_4_bg_jiedao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-615801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-615801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-615801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">街头商人：</div><div>来自巴西的苏卡拉特兽触须，炼制“凉飕飕药剂”的绝佳材料！<br />——仅售185颗利齿子儿！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-615801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-615801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-615801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">街头商人：</div><div>这位小姐，你不打算购买一点儿吗？里约热内卢的兄弟姐妹们会永远铭记着您的慷慨～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>哇哦——！<br />这样的好东西你还藏着多少？统统拿出来——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>船长……我必须提醒你，苏芙比小姐并未参与此次的澳洲之行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>噢，好吧～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>眼前的诱惑似乎源源不断。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-501402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-501402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-501402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">街头艺术家：</div><div>♪——♫——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>颜料与歌声一同飞舞，差点溅到了船长的墨镜上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>嘿、嘿嘿！老兄，颜料可不是这么使的，我非常建议你尝试波普艺术，再邋遢的艺术家碰上它也能摇身一变，吸引街上所有人的注意～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>说真的，你该找个机会到伦敦去，在那儿你能学到不少街头宣传的技巧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-501402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-501402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-501402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">街头艺术家：</div><div>波普……那不是几十年前的老古董吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>什么——？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在船长践行她的摇滚精神前，不远处传来的欢呼声及时阻止了这场争端。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>我听到了几个重要的字眼，APPLe先生，我们必须尽快赶往那儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>难道是……重塑之手？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>维尔汀小姐曾委托过我们，希望大家在澳大利亚出游时，留意可能出现的重塑门徒……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>不——比那更加重要！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-baiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"baiping\"><img alt=\"baiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/600px-Cg-baiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/900px-Cg-baiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/1200px-Cg-baiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_4_at_jietouyanzou1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_4_at_jietouyanzou1\"><img alt=\"2_4_at_jietouyanzou1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/Cg-2_4_at_jietouyanzou1.png/600px-Cg-2_4_at_jietouyanzou1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/Cg-2_4_at_jietouyanzou1.png/900px-Cg-2_4_at_jietouyanzou1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/Cg-2_4_at_jietouyanzou1.png/1200px-Cg-2_4_at_jietouyanzou1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_4_at_xingti2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_4_at_xingti2\"><img alt=\"2_4_at_xingti2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Cg-2_4_at_xingti2.png/600px-Cg-2_4_at_xingti2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Cg-2_4_at_xingti2.png/900px-Cg-2_4_at_xingti2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Cg-2_4_at_xingti2.png/1200px-Cg-2_4_at_xingti2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_4_at_jietouyanzou1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_4_at_jietouyanzou1\"><img alt=\"2_4_at_jietouyanzou1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/Cg-2_4_at_jietouyanzou1.png/600px-Cg-2_4_at_jietouyanzou1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/Cg-2_4_at_jietouyanzou1.png/900px-Cg-2_4_at_jietouyanzou1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/Cg-2_4_at_jietouyanzou1.png/1200px-Cg-2_4_at_jietouyanzou1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">宣传船员：</div><div>女士们，先生们——！<br />欢迎来到全澳大利亚最最最盛大的游轮启航派对！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">宣传船员：</div><div>您期待着一段独一无二的旅程吗？您渴望投入一个温暖湿润的怀抱吗？您也热爱音乐吗？那么此刻，正是最好的时机——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">宣传船员：</div><div>“自由海风号”即将启航！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">宣传船员：</div><div>澳元、利齿子儿、神秘学素材，或是一切具有价值的珍藏，我们慷慨的船长允诺，“自由海风号”的门票绝不受限～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">宣传船员：</div><div>只需要一点儿小小的投资，您便能近距离欣赏自由乐器大师芭卡洛儿小姐与她的神奇乐器“啪唧匣子”的个人秀！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>此起彼伏的欢呼声愈发高涨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">宣传船员：</div><div>当然，我们也为囊中羞涩的朋友提供了一个宝贵的机会——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">宣传船员：</div><div>我们最为热情的朋友，将有机会得到一张<b><span style=\"font-size:122%\">免费</span></b>登上游轮的船票！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-302511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-302511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-302511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>没错！我要找的就是这个！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>……果然如此。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">宣传船员：</div><div>尽情欢呼吧，朋友们！为芭卡洛儿小姐的演出，为那天籁般的乐声！与我们一同环游世界——！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_4_at_jietouyanzou2_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_4_at_jietouyanzou2_zone\"><img alt=\"2_4_at_jietouyanzou2_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-2_4_at_jietouyanzou2_zone.png/600px-Cg-2_4_at_jietouyanzou2_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"633\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-2_4_at_jietouyanzou2_zone.png/900px-Cg-2_4_at_jietouyanzou2_zone.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/e/ec/Cg-2_4_at_jietouyanzou2_zone.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"936\" data-file-height=\"988\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>喔～～～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>溢美之辞从宣传员的口中井喷而出，舞台中央的明星悄悄侧过脸去。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_4_bg_jiedao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_4_bg_jiedao\"><img alt=\"2_4_bg_jiedao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/Cg-2_4_bg_jiedao.png/600px-Cg-2_4_bg_jiedao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/Cg-2_4_bg_jiedao.png/900px-Cg-2_4_bg_jiedao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/Cg-2_4_bg_jiedao.png/1200px-Cg-2_4_bg_jiedao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>这样的宣传词也太夸张了……汉米西先生……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>我很乐意为“自由海风号”尽一份力，但它的成功属于每一位船员，过、过高的评价不……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-520601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-520601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-520601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">宣传船员：</div><div>“过高的评价不利于培养出一位伟大的音乐大师”，我完全理解，芭卡洛儿小姐——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-520601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-520601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-520601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">宣传船员：</div><div>可事实上，我们的客人大多都是冲着您和您的独门乐器来的，我相信，您的名气一定会为“自由海风号”招徕更多的客人～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>好吧……这不是为了我自己，而是为了我们的“自由海风号”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-520601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-520601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-520601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">宣传船员：</div><div>当然，芭卡洛儿小姐～<br />另外……您认识那位过于热情的客人么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>嗯？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_4_bg_jiedao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_4_bg_jiedao\"><img alt=\"2_4_bg_jiedao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/Cg-2_4_bg_jiedao.png/600px-Cg-2_4_bg_jiedao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/Cg-2_4_bg_jiedao.png/900px-Cg-2_4_bg_jiedao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/Cg-2_4_bg_jiedao.png/1200px-Cg-2_4_bg_jiedao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\"></div><div>她朝着船员手指的方向望去，那儿有派对中格外热情的一角。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\"></div><div>一位红白相间的女士与一颗飘浮的苹果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520611.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-520611.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520611.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520611.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-520611.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520611.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-520611.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520611.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">宣传船员：</div><div>在那位女士的影响下，我们已经卖出去几十张船票了……以前从来没卖得这么快过！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>朋友们！你们应该都明白这个毫无争议的事实——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>海风，轮船，音乐——还有什么比这更棒的组合呢？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>每个人一生中都至少应该参与一场这样的音乐派对，否则我们的人生将毫无意义！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>燥起来，朋友们！将你们手中的硬币抛向天空，让它们落入我面前的口袋——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>记住——那最清脆的咔嗒声将是你们与音乐的灵魂共鸣——！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">众人：</div><div>喔——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\"></div><div>派对上的欢呼声一浪高过一浪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>澳大利亚的客人们，都像她这么热情吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-520601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-520601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-520601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">宣传船员：</div><div>没人知道，我的小姐。要不是船长对新船员的要求苛刻，我都打算举荐她加入我们的“自由海风号”了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她朝着那个自由摇摆的身影赞许地点了点头，将怀中的啪唧匣子抱得更紧了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>没错，世界上有太多的人需要像她这样具有音乐品味的朋友去感染……比如我们古板的新船长！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>她为什么非得解雇“自由海风号”的老海员们，换成那些什么也不懂、只会制造噪音的怪家伙呢——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>数道惊讶的目光落到了芭卡洛儿的身上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-520601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-520601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-520601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">宣传船员：</div><div>嘘——芭卡洛儿女士，请别再说了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他踮起脚尖，朝着轮船的方向探头探脑，许久，才不自然地缩了缩脖子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"521401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-521401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-521401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"521401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-521401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-521401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-521401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-521401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">圆滑的船员：</div><div>伙计们，咱们没听到过任何关于新船长的意见，对吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"521501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-521501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-521501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"521501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-521501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-521501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-521501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-521501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">忧心的船员：</div><div>当、当然！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\"></div><div>船员们眼神飘忽，小声地咳嗽起来，好催促尴尬的时间尽快过去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>客人们来来往往，不知疲倦的曲子一首接一首地流淌着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>启航派对终于抵达了尾声。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_4_bg_jiedao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_4_bg_jiedao\"><img alt=\"2_4_bg_jiedao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/Cg-2_4_bg_jiedao.png/600px-Cg-2_4_bg_jiedao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/Cg-2_4_bg_jiedao.png/900px-Cg-2_4_bg_jiedao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/Cg-2_4_bg_jiedao.png/1200px-Cg-2_4_bg_jiedao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>船长，我们是不是该去科算中心了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>当然不是，大副！难道你不认为我们是那欢呼声最高、能赢回免费船票的幸运儿吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>我赞同你的观点。<br />……但那些船员们似乎已经在收拾东西了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:166%\">什么——？！！！</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“星锑号”舰船迅速拦截了即将离开的“自由海风号”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-520601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-520601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-520601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">宣传船员：</div><div>这位客人，派对已经结束。请谅解，芭卡洛儿小姐不再提供签名服务了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>不！是我的免费船票——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>难道你们能在这儿找到比我更热情的观众吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-520601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-520601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-520601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">宣传船员：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-520601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-520601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-520601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">宣传船员：</div><div>很抱歉，女士，幸运儿的噱头只是一种简单的宣传策略。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-520601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-520601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-520601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">宣传船员：</div><div>更何况，“自由海风号”的船票相当紧俏，无数朋友都翘首以待着这一趟旅行，至于免费的客舱……我想你可以等待我们返航时再来咨询。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>你——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>船长，请冷静。他们确实不曾透露关于幸运儿选拔的任何细节。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\"></div><div>星锑抬头四顾，路人零零星星，早已没有一开始的热闹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\"></div><div>显然，这儿无人能为她主持公道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>你们这是赤裸裸的欺诈！我要去澳大利亚旅游局投诉你们！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-520601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-520601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-520601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">宣传船员：</div><div>我完全理解您的愤怒，但“自由海风号”将在几天后离港。我想，届时您的投诉进度应该还停留在表格投递环节。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310813.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-310813.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310813.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310813.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-310813.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310813.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-310813.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310813.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\"></div><div>皱起眉头的少女将船员先生扯到一边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>汉米西先生，我认为这一行为有损“自由海风号”的声誉。如果可以的话，我愿意将我的舱室转借给这位小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>至于费用，请从我的工资里扣除！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-520601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-520601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-520601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">宣传船员：</div><div>您已经无数次这样做了，芭卡洛儿小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-520601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-520601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-520601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">宣传船员：</div><div>可这一次，我恐怕不能答应您了。您应该知道新船长对于船客们的审核有多严格，她绝不会允许毫无价值的客人登船的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>但……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小声的嘀咕让投诉无门的客人摸不着头脑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>嘿，伙计们——你们打算逃避问题到什么时候？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-520601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-520601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-520601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">宣传船员：</div><div>好吧，这位小姐，鉴于您在本次游轮宣传活动的突出表现，本“自由海风号”宣传员将破例给您准备一份精美的纪念品——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-520601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-520601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-520601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">宣传船员：</div><div>——以感谢您对“自由海风号”宣传活动的有力支持。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一沓颇有分量的“纪念品”被塞到了星锑的手里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>握着马克笔的游轮明星奔上前来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310810.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-310810.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310810.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310810.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-310810.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310810.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-310810.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310810.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>等等——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310817.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/HeadIconSmall-310817.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310817.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310817.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/HeadIconSmall-310817.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310817.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/HeadIconSmall-310817.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310817.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>很抱歉，小姐。希望您能接受我的私人补偿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310817.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/HeadIconSmall-310817.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310817.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310817.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/HeadIconSmall-310817.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310817.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/HeadIconSmall-310817.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310817.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>愿我们未来能在“自由海风号”上再见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>哈？</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "LEE-02"}}